# Daily review digest: vault decision-queue notes (Blog Ideas, Skill
# Proposals, Tips and Tricks, Topics, Market Watch) emailed with signed
# accept/decline/track/adopt buttons. Runs after the nightly generators
# that fill those queues, so the queues are fresh.
# Nothing pending = no email. Exits 1 only when the email could not be
# delivered.
JOB_SCHEDULE="30 7 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-obsidian-review/obsidian-review.sh\" run"
